<title>USA: BankUnited Financial Q4 loss from charge.</title>
<headline>BankUnited Financial Q4 loss from charge.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL GABLES, Fla. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary loss	 $0.12   profit	 $1.80</p>
<p> Shr diluted loss	  0.12   profit	  1.11</p>
<p> Net loss		     152   profit	 4,963</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 5,703		    2,364</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 5,703		    4,227</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  YEAR</p>
<p> Shr primary profit     $0.10   profit	 $1.77</p>
<p> Shr diluted profit	0.10   profit	  1.26</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,586   profit	 6,240</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 4,558		    2,296</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 4,557		    4,159</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Periods ended September 30.</p>
<p>Full name of the company is BankUnited Financial Corp.</p>
<p>1996 periods include a charge of $1.62 million after tax from SAIF assessment.</p>
<p>1995 periods include a $5.8 million after tax gain on the sale of three branches.</p>
<p>Total assets at Sept. 30: $824.4 million vs $608.4 million.</p>
<p>Net loans receivable at Sept. 30: $646.4 million vs $453.4 million.</p>
<p>Deposits at Sept. 30 - $506.1 million vs $310.1 million.</p>
